msgid "Adds Schema.org/Article to the JSON LD array. Creates Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle or APIReference."
msgstr "Fügt Schema.org/Article zum JSON-LD-Array hinzu. Erstellt Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle oder APIReference."

